# Keeper-backed environment variables, loaded by cetec-astronomy.
#
# Each line: VAR_NAME [search tags...]
# The Keeper record is titled env:global:VAR_NAME; the secret is its password field.
# Add entries with `secrets-add VAR_NAME [tags...]`, or edit this file directly.
# Tags are optional words that `secrets-refresh` and `secrets-unset` filters match.
#
# To silence a Keeper env:global record you don't want loaded: ignore VAR_NAME
#
# Examples:
# OPENAI_API_KEY           openai ai
# GITHUB_TOKEN             github git
# ignore OLD_API_KEY
